GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_SuperNerdEricIntro::
	.string "I got booted out of the GAME\n"
	.string "CORNER.\p"
	.string "I was trying to cheat using my\n"
	.string "POKéMON...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_SuperNerdEricDefeat::
	.string "...Grumble...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_SuperNerdEric::
	.string "I guess I have to do things fair and\n"
	.string "square...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_PokemaniacIssacIntro::
	.string "My POKéMON just got haircuts!\p"
	.string "I’ll show you how strong they are!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_PokemaniacIssacDefeat::
	.string "Aiyeeee!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_PokemaniacIssac::
	.string "Your POKéMON will like you more if\n"
	.string "you give them haircuts.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_OldWoman_1::
	.string "Hello, dear.\p"
	.string "I sell inexpensive herbal medicine.\p"
	.string "They’re good, but a trifle bitter.\n"
	.string "Your POKéMON may not like them.\p"
	.string "Hehehehe...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_OldWoman_2::
	.string "Come again, dear.\n"
	.string "Hehehehe...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_Man_1::
	.string "Welcome to the POKéMON SALON!\p"
	.string "I’ll spiff up your POKéMON for just\n"
	.string " 300. So how about it?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_Man_2::
	.string "No?\n"
	.string "How disappointing!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_Man_3::
	.string "I can do only one haircut a day.\n"
	.string "Sorry, but I’m all done for today.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_Man_4::
	.string "You’re a little short on funds.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_Man_5::
	.string "OK, which POKéMON should I do?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_Man_6::
	.string "OK! I’ll make it look cool!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_Man_7::
	.string "There we go!\n"
	.string "All done!\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{STR_VAR_1} looks happy.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_Man_8::
	.string "Sorry, I can’t do a haircut to\n"
	.string "an EGG.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_GymSign_1::
	.string "The door’s locked...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_GymSign_2::
	.string "The BASEMENT KEY opened the door.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_OldMan1_1::
	.string "Hiya! Care to see some bargains?\p"
	.string "I sell rare items that nobody else\n"
	.string "carries. Unfortunately I have only\l"
	.string "this NUGGET left...\p"
	.string "I could sell you this NUGGET for\n"
	.string " 4500, what do you say?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_OldMan1_2::
	.string "Come by again sometime.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_OldMan1_3::
	.string "We’re not open today.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_OldMan1_4::
	.string "Thanks.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_OldMan1_5::
	.string "I’m sorry to say this. You don’t\n"
	.string "have enough money...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_SuperNerdTeruIntro::
	.string "Do you consider type alignments in\n"
	.string "battle?\p"
	.string "If you know your type advantages,\n"
	.string "you’ll do better in battle.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_SuperNerdTeruDefeat::
	.string "Ow, ow, ow!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_SuperNerdTeru::
	.string "I know my POKéMON type alignments.\n"
	.string "But I only use one type of POKéMON.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_PokemaniacDonaldIntro::
	.string "I think you have some rare POKéMON\n"
	.string "with you.\p"
	.string "Let me see them!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_PokemaniacDonaldDefeat::
	.string "Gaah! I lost!\n"
	.string "That makes me mad!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior2_Text_PokemaniacDonald::
	.string "Are you making a POKéDEX? Here’s a\n"
	.string "hot tip.\p"
	.string "The HIKER on ROUTE 33, ANTHONY, is\n"
	.string "a good guy.\p"
	.string "He’ll phone you if he sees any rare\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"
